---

<section class="did-you-know">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="dyk" data-anim="scale">
      <span class="dyk__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M9 20h6"></path>
          <path d="M10 23h4"></path>
          <path d="M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-4 12.7V17h8v-2.3A7 7 0 0 0 12 2z"></path>
        </svg>
      </span>
      <p class="dyk__text">
        Cliente confia mais em empresa com visual padronizado.
        <strong>A farda da sua equipe é a primeira coisa que ele vê.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .did-you-know {
    padding-bottom: var(--section-y);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .dyk {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    background: var(--orange-050);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .dyk__icon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: var(--pill);
    color: var(--orange-600);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .dyk__icon svg {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
  }

  .dyk__text {
    font-size: clamp(18px, 1rem + 1vw, 26px);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--blue-900);
  }

  .dyk__text strong {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  @media (min-width: 480px) {
    .dyk {
      gap: 22px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
    }

    .dyk__icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1080px) {
    .dyk {
      gap: 36px;
      padding: 48px 56px;
    }

    .dyk__icon {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
    }

    .dyk__icon svg {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
    }
  }
</style>
